# Butler Routes - Dustwallow Marsh completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.38.0).
# Every Dustwallow Marsh quest in the local census (45 quests, docs/dustwallow-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# No race header: nothing contracted is race-locked, so per-line `only` class
# gates carry the rest (Mage chain, Warlock pair, one Paladin quest).
# Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept; out-of-contract pres become
# notes plus listed structural warnings. Item- and object-started quests never
# wedge (note at the source, sourcing optional); writs and the crafted blade
# take the Ashenvale R5 handling (optional + when skill + bag note).
# Coordinates use the era frame the data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-marsh
title Dustwallow Marsh - Completionist
levels 35-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Theramore - landfall

  zone map 1445

  tip Theramore Isle is the hub: Fiora (66.46, 45.15) posts the Astranaar board, Samaul (68.02, 48.71) opens the diplomat line, Tervosh (66.42, 49.26) works the tower, Byron (66.15, 46.07) watches the gate, VanHowzen (67.76, 48.97) runs triage, Janene (66.59, 45.22) keeps the inn, Helenia (66.44, 51.46) sells spices, Jameson (65.50, 45.39) drills the guard, and Elrick (66.45, 45.35) holds a paladin word. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  note 1133's pre (1132, a Wetlands accept) lives outside this guide - take 1133 on its own and carry the word north.
  accept 1133 -- Journey to Astranaar - Fiora Longears; Shindrell Swiftfire waits in Astranaar
  accept 1135 -- Highperch Venom - Fiora Longears; ten Venom Sacs off the Thousand Needles wyverns
  note 1265's pre (1264, a Wetlands accept) lives outside this guide - take the diplomat line on its own.
  accept 1265 -- The Missing Diplomat - Commander Samaul; Archmage Tervosh takes the word
  complete 1265 @66.42,49.26 era -- the diplomat word to Archmage Tervosh in the tower
  turnin 1265 -- The Missing Diplomat - the word to Archmage Tervosh
  accept 1282 -- They Call Him Smiling Jim - Guard Byron; Captain Vimes takes the word
  accept 81765 only Paladin -- Elrick, Paladin of the Silver Hand - Elrick; Innkeeper Janene takes the word
  turnin 81765 only Paladin -- Elrick, Paladin of the Silver Hand - the word to Innkeeper Janene
  accept 98233 -- Sword in the Slime - Guard Jameson; a training sword off the corrosive ooze south
  accept 7070 -- Shadowshard Fragments - Archmage Tervosh; ten fragments off the Desolace rumblers

step Theramore - triage (First Aid)

  zone map 1445

  when skill First Aid 1

  note 6624's pre (6625, an Ironforge accept) lives outside this guide - take triage on its own.
  accept 6624 -- Triage - Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen; the wounded in the infirmary
  complete 6624 @67.76,48.97 era -- the triage in VanHowzen's infirmary
  turnin 6624 -- Triage - the triage to Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen

step Astranaar - Journey's end

  zone map 1440

  tip Shindrell Swiftfire (34.67, 48.84) holds the Astranaar end of Fiora's board. Turn in, ride back to the marsh.
  turnin 1133 -- Journey to Astranaar - Fiora's word to Shindrell Swiftfire
  zone map 1445

step North post - Hendel's line

  zone map 1445

  goto 45.24,24.65

  tip The north post: Hendel (45.24, 24.65) holds the line, Tervosh (45.20, 24.40) works the tower tent, Jaina (45.20, 24.30) keeps the command. Hendel's death is the job - Tervosh and Jaina close it.
  accept 1266 -- The Missing Diplomat - Private Hendel; carry the word
  turnin 1266 -- The Missing Diplomat - the word to Private Hendel
  accept 1324 -- The Missing Diplomat - Private Hendel; Hendel's end at the post
  complete 1324 @45.24,24.65 era -- Private Hendel brought down at the north post
  turnin 1324 -- The Missing Diplomat - the news to Archmage Tervosh
  accept 1267 -- The Missing Diplomat - Lady Jaina Proudmoore; the line closes with her
  turnin 1267 -- The Missing Diplomat - the line to Lady Jaina Proudmoore

step West road - Jarl and the dirt

  zone map 1445

  tip The west road: Loose Dirt (55.44, 25.92) by Jarl's camp starts the Orc report; Jarl (55.44, 26.27) wants spices, eyes and a blade; Stinky (46.88, 17.52) plans his escape in the west. Buy three Soothing Spices from Helenia Olden in Theramore (66.44, 51.46) before you close Jarl's first ask.
  note The Loose Dirt sits by Jarl's camp; the report goes to the Theramore Lieutenant back east.
  accept 1219 -- The Orc Report - the Loose Dirt; the Theramore Lieutenant takes it
  accept 1218 -- Soothing Spices - "Swamp Eye" Jarl; three Soothing Spices from Helenia Olden
  accept 1222 -- Stinky's Escape - "Stinky" Ignatz; the escape at his camp
  complete 1222 @46.88,17.52 era -- Stinky's escape at his western camp

step Theramore - the board

  zone map 1445

  tip The Lieutenant (65.00, 47.00) takes the Orc report; Vimes (68.21, 48.62) holds the deserters board; Tesoran (68.05, 48.11) musters Daelin's men; Caz (64.75, 50.43) checks the Black Shield; Stern (66.34, 45.47) stews the soup. Work the board before the western hunt.
  turnin 1219 -- The Orc Report - the report to the Theramore Lieutenant
  accept 1220 -- Captain Vimes - the Theramore Lieutenant; Captain Vimes takes the word
  turnin 1220 -- Captain Vimes - the word to Captain Garran Vimes
  note 1319's pre (1253, a Barrens accept) lives outside this guide - take the shield line on its own.
  accept 1319 -- The Black Shield - Captain Garran Vimes; Caz Twosprocket takes it
  turnin 1319 -- The Black Shield - the shield to Caz Twosprocket
  accept 1320 -- The Black Shield - Caz Twosprocket; Captain Vimes closes it
  turnin 1320 -- The Black Shield - the shield to Captain Garran Vimes
  turnin 1282 -- They Call Him Smiling Jim - the word to Captain Garran Vimes
  complete 1218 @66.44,51.46 era -- three Soothing Spices from Helenia Olden in town
  note 1259's pre (1252, a Barrens accept) lives outside this guide - take Daelin's line on its own.
  accept 1259 -- Lieutenant Paval Reethe - Captain Garran Vimes; Adjutant Tesoran takes it
  turnin 1259 -- Lieutenant Paval Reethe - the word to Adjutant Tesoran
  accept 1285 -- Daelin's Men - Captain Garran Vimes; Adjutant Tesoran musters them
  turnin 1285 -- Daelin's Men - the muster to Adjutant Tesoran
  accept 1286 -- The Deserters - Captain Garran Vimes; Balos Jacken waits in the west
  turnin 1222 -- Stinky's Escape - the escape to Morgan Stern
  note 1204's pre (1260, a Stormwind accept) lives outside this guide - take the soup on its own.
  accept 1204 -- Mudrock Soup and Bugs - Morgan Stern; eight tongues off the northern tortoises

step West - Balos and the writs

  zone map 1445

  tip Balos Jacken (36.09, 54.31) deserts in the far west; Mudcrush Durtfeet (35.15, 38.26) and Ugbert (40.99, 27.88) take writs out here. Vimes's Report (6075) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags before this leg.
  turnin 1286 -- The Deserters - the deserters to Balos Jacken
  note 1288's pre (1287, a Barrens accept) lives outside this guide; its starter Vimes's Report has no placed source - have it in your bags.
  accept 1288 -- Vimes's Report - use the report, then carry it to Lady Jaina

