step Jarl - the eyes and the blade

  zone map 1445

  tip Jarl (55.44, 26.27) takes the eyes. The Moonsteel Broadsword (3853) has no source in the data - have it in your bags (auction house or a blacksmith) before this step.
  turnin 1206 -- Jarl Needs Eyes - the eyes to "Swamp Eye" Jarl

