  zone map 1445

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 55.44,26.27
  accept 1203 optional -- Jarl Needs a Blade - "Swamp Eye" Jarl; a Moonsteel Broadsword in your bags
  note The Moonsteel Broadsword (3853) has no source in the data - have it in your bags (auction house or a blacksmith).
  turnin 1203 optional -- Jarl Needs a Blade - the blade to "Swamp Eye" Jarl

step South - Tabetha's circle

  zone map 1445

  tip Tabetha (46.06, 57.09) works the southern marsh: the mage line (Jade and a Bramble from Arathi), the warlock orb, Hidden Secrets for the Needles, Rituals, and Tiara work. Her pres (1947 Mulgore, 1953 Durotar, 1799 Barrens, 2861 Mulgore) live outside this guide - take each line on its own.
  accept 1948 only Mage -- Items of Power - Tabetha; a Jade and a Bolt Charged Bramble
  accept 1954 only Mage -- The Infernal Orb - Tabetha; an Infernal Orb off the Desolace summoners
  accept 1949 only Mage -- Hidden Secrets - Tabetha; Magus Tirth waits in Thousand Needles
  accept 4961 only Warlock -- Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil - Tabetha; a Demon of the Orb by her hut
  accept 2846 -- Tiara of the Deep - Tabetha; the tiara for her finale

