step Arathi - the bramble

  zone map 1417

  tip The Bolt Charged Bramble (103662) sits alone in the Arathi highlands (52.00, 50.80); Tabetha back in the marsh takes it for the mage work.
  complete 1948 only Mage @52.00,50.80 era -- the Bolt Charged Bramble in the Arathi highlands

step South - Tabetha closes

  zone map 1445

  tip Tabetha (46.06, 57.09) closes the circle: the Demon of the Orb (45.79, 56.97) and the Mana Surge (45.83, 56.94) stand by her hut. The Obsidian Power Source (8053) and the Tiara of the Deep (9234) have no placed source in the data - their droppers are unmapped, so have both in your bags.
  turnin 1954 only Mage -- The Infernal Orb - the orb to Tabetha
  accept 1955 only Mage -- The Exorcism - Tabetha; a Demon of the Orb by her hut
  complete 1955 only Mage @45.79,56.97 era -- a Demon of the Orb brought down by her hut
  turnin 1955 only Mage -- The Exorcism - the exorcism to Tabetha
  accept 1956 only Mage -- Power in Uldaman - Tabetha; an Obsidian Power Source for the work
  complete 1956 only Mage -- an Obsidian Power Source for Tabetha's work
  turnin 1956 only Mage -- Power in Uldaman - the source to Tabetha
  accept 1957 only Mage -- Mana Surges - Tabetha; twelve Mana Surges by her hut
  complete 1957 only Mage @45.83,56.94 era -- twelve Mana Surges by Tabetha's hut
  turnin 1957 only Mage -- Mana Surges - the surges to Tabetha
  accept 1958 only Mage -- Celestial Power - Tabetha; the circle closes
  turnin 1958 only Mage -- Celestial Power - the circle to Tabetha
  complete 4961 only Warlock @45.79,56.97 era -- a Demon of the Orb brought down by her hut
  turnin 4961 only Warlock -- Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil - the orb to Tabetha
  accept 4976 only Warlock -- Returning the Cleansed Orb - Tabetha; Menara Voidrender waits in the Barrens
  complete 2846 -- the Tiara of the Deep for Tabetha's finale
  turnin 2846 -- Tiara of the Deep - the tiara to Tabetha

