step Far south - the goblin trio

  zone map 1445

  loop
  goto 37.20,74.60
  goto 41.00,63.60
  goto 42.40,81.80
  goto 44.20,71.00
  goto 45.00,63.40
  kill 4323 optional
  tip The Searing whelps nest the far south; Drazzit Dripvalve (41.01, 75.73) and Gizzix Grimegurgle (40.97, 75.68) work the same camp. Eight of each whelp for Drazzit, twenty scales and ten wyrmtails for the pair, and a Jade for Tabetha's mage work. The Wyrmtail source (671644) is unmapped in the data - have ten in your bags.
  accept 98205 -- Whelps are the Worst! - Drazzit Dripvalve; eight of each southern whelp
  accept 98215 -- Dragon Scales, Post Burnt Tails - Drazzit Dripvalve; twenty scales off the southern whelps
  accept 98231 -- Active Ingredient - Gizzix Grimegurgle; ten Wyrmtails from your bags
  complete 98205 @41.00,63.60 era -- eight Searing Hatchlings and eight Searing Whelps in the southern nests
  complete 98215 @41.00,63.60 era -- twenty Shed Dark Dragonscales off the southern whelps
  complete 98231 -- ten Wyrmtails for Gizzix Grimegurgle
  complete 1948 only Mage @41.00,63.60 era -- a Jade off the southern whelps for the mage work
  turnin 98205 -- Whelps are the Worst! - the whelps to Drazzit Dripvalve
  turnin 98215 -- Dragon Scales, Post Burnt Tails - the scales to Drazzit Dripvalve
  turnin 98231 -- Active Ingredient - the tails to Gizzix Grimegurgle

