  turnin 1948 only Mage -- Items of Power - the Jade and the Bramble to Tabetha
  accept 1952 only Mage -- Mage's Wand - Tabetha; the wand she offers
  turnin 1952 only Mage -- Mage's Wand - the wand to Tabetha

